= The cabinet holds

Our ministers do not resign. The statement is four sentences long and every one
of them is about the programme: the housing budget, the clinical-access
guidance, the labour inspectorate. The word *Giertych* does not appear in it,
which is the first thing every journalist notices.

The government survives intact. So does everything this party has spent the
parliament building, and that is not a small list — it is the reason, and it is
a real reason, and it will be worth exactly as much in two years as it is
today.

Razem's council meets the same night. The progressive deputies who came in
through Wiosna hold their own meeting and do not invite the leadership to it.
The women's organisations that counted deputies for us in April 2024 issue a
joint statement that does not name us and does not need to. The PPS current,
which is eleven people and a newspaper, publishes the 2006 circulars beside our
four sentences on one page.

Our own membership figures will show it in September. We have converted the
most authentic thing this party owns — that the people who ran the schools
campaign against him in 2006 were us — into a fact about the past.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the four sentences

